{"t":"The Soul Wells","s":"the-soul-wells-12b47","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Betrayed_Wraith_21746a.gif","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>The Soul Wells is a stage in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Forge\">Demon Forge</a> and is the route to the demon boss <a href=\"#/wiki/Annihilon\">Annihilon</a>. This is the second and final stage leading to the demon boss. Players arrive here after navigating <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Arcanum\">The Arcanum</a> and will gain access to the Hive once <a href=\"#/wiki/Annihilon\">Annihilon</a> has been slain.\n</p><p><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Forge\">Demon Forge</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Arcanum\">The Arcanum</a>, The Hive (Demon Forge), and <a href=\"#/wiki/Annihilon\">Annihilon</a> </i> </span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Betrayed%20Wraith\"><img alt=\"Betrayed Wraith\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Betrayed_Wraith_21746a.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Betrayed%20Wraith\">Betrayed Wraith</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">3,500</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">4,200</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">455</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\